# Dev only (auto-loaded by Vite in `vite dev`, never in production builds).
# Connect socket.io straight to the backend instead of through Vite's dev proxy,
# which otherwise logs harmless ECONNRESET/EPIPE on every page reload/HMR.
# The backend gateway allows CORS '*', so a direct cross-origin ws works in dev.
VITE_WS_URL=http://localhost:3001
